(7736177, 1275422, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out why this isn''t doing anything for me, because it has some good potential. It''s not bad, but not appealing to me either. It seems a little flat without anything jumping out at me. I think perhaps my eye is cruising past those interesting tugboats to land on the apartments in the background. Perhaps some selective editing could have helped to bring out some of the nice details in the boats to make my eye stop there. A solid 5 for me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out why this isn''t doing anything for me, because it has some good potential. It''s not bad, but not appealing to me either. It seems a little flat without anything jumping out at me. I think perhaps my eye is cruising past those interesting tugboats to land on the apartments in the background. Perhaps some selective editing could have helped to bring out some of the nice details in the boats to make my eye stop there. A solid 5 for me, I''m afraid.', '2023-01-06 17:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
